{"time": 1761140117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859698482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "凭借你精湛的导航技术，即便是在如此之大的风雪中，你也成功找到了失去理智的阿德莱德。也许是生物趋利避害的本能，你发现阿德莱德即便已经崩溃甚至无法思考，她也本能的蹲在一块足以阻挡暴风雪地岩壁下颤抖。"}
{"time": 1761140200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560336568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“女士，你怎么了？刚刚发生了什么？我理解失去挚友的心情……但在这里会出事的”"}
{"time": 1761140246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96632885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "她用着诡异的尖锐声音不断喃喃着：“......真菌......贝里昂......艾琳.......来不及了！！！已经开始了！！！”"}
{"time": 1761140317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557824370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你意识到阿德莱德此时已经陷入疯狂，已经无法正常的进行交谈。"}
{"time": 1761140330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209495059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道，我知道……但我们还有事要做的对吧”"}
{"time": 1761140448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453425001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“不要过来！！......啊啊啊——远离！！！......来不及了......”阿德莱德用嘶哑的声音哭喊着。"}
{"time": 1761140470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493708055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你意识到她想再次逃离你。"}
{"time": 1761140608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156542300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*秉持着人道主义原则，上前去拉她"}
{"time": 1761140665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725084256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*拉不住就只能回去，卡德伍现在是一样的情况"}
{"time": 1761140735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466504824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "那么即便她哭喊着想要逃离你，你也轻轻松松把她摁在原地。"}
{"time": 1761140818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613740045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了，我们会走的，我们一起下山。我去叫上卡德伍……”"}
{"time": 1761140864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28273851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "那么你轻轻松松地把手无缚鸡之力的阿德莱德带回了山洞。"}
{"time": 1761140952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635977277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“卡德伍，卡德伍？”*看看洞里什么情况"}
{"time": 1761140962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975488995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "山洞中，你见到默默处理自己伤口的安杰，他看起来有些恍惚。"}
{"time": 1761140991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819071641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“你回来了......”"}
{"time": 1761141037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220983652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "注意到被你绑回来的阿德莱德，“......阿德莱德怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1761141088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175519300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“卡德伍……她有点被吓到了。艾琳呢？”*艾琳两字只做口型"}
{"time": 1761141125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299311577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“那不是艾琳......”"}
{"time": 1761141167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25932598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "把艾琳被贝里昂啃食的部分指给穆勒看"}
{"time": 1761141173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975424808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真高兴你能意识到这点”"}
{"time": 1761141286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93648380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在你……怎么看她？”"}
{"time": 1761141322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217213369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "艾琳依旧呆呆地坐在原地，似乎身上缺少的部分对她而言从未存在过。在破损的肢体中没有任何存在与人类有关的部分，早已经被诡异的真菌所填满。就好像一个大号的布娃娃，只不过棉花换成了真菌，你无法理解它是怎么活起来的。"}
{"time": 1761141412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598218802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我觉得你应该早就知道了，只是在骗自己”"}
{"time": 1761141456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572613967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“艾琳已经死了，我一直知道的......我只是侥幸，我以为奇迹可能会降临，就如当初活下来的我，就是在雪崩中活到现在的我们......但是我一直欺骗自己，强迫自己对那些诡异的存在视而不见。”"}
{"time": 1761141500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579604468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“我们必须活下去.....”#红着眼，泪痕在脸上冻结"}
{"time": 1761141565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772386868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……在那之前，做个了断吧。就当对过去的告别”"}
{"time": 1761141594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412257589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“你来吧，我还是下不去手。请你让艾琳安息吧。”"}
{"time": 1761141654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060039137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像天主教不提倡火化）"}
{"time": 1761141715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880939148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“我想普通的刀子应该无法结束那种存在的生命，我想.....火应该是它们唯一的弱点了。”"}
{"time": 1761141715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754122300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，抱歉。有什么话可以趁现在说，虽然她听不见了……但是说不定她在听”"}
{"time": 1761141789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093313084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "那么你看见安杰最后拥抱了一次艾琳，注视着呆呆的她，但是没有说话。"}
