{"time": 1761144877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405819241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你逐渐失去意识，在朦胧中你似乎听到安杰焦急的呼喊声。当你再次张开眼，你已经身处一个陌生的山洞中。"}
{"time": 1761144911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58161458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（换了个洞？）"}
{"time": 1761144945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588827212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你发现，这个山洞和你梦中所见一模一样。"}
{"time": 1761144981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279800941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这里……是……”*微微出声“是这里啊……卡德伍”"}
{"time": 1761145003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007095473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你在最后的意识里，听到这样几句话。"}
{"time": 1761145019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654837398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "3496412852"}, "sender": {"id": "3496412852", "name": "二阶堂"}, "message": "“历史重演了，这一次，我站在了这个位置。你在这里待好，我一定会为你找到救援的，等着我，我马上就会回来。”"}
{"time": 1761145056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39146320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "......"}
{"time": 1761145069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376418971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别……不能去……”*试图说出这样的话"}
{"time": 1761145138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287588778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你无法说话，只得在余光中，看着眼前这个在绝境中仍意志坚定的青年，一头扎进吃人的，无穷的风雪中。"}
{"time": 1761145166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816345377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "一片黑暗后，你再次醒来，发现自己回到了急救室中。"}
{"time": 1761145173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221322429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "布莱恩警官关切看着你：“怎么样？有想起什么线索吗？”"}
{"time": 1761145227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295231477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（其实我们这个团拖得时间有点长，但是我相信你可以想起线索的雾！）"}
