{"time": 1761145449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104524705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我想想，不急（）"}
{"time": 1761145658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045868159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“山……山顶……最后在山顶……但是不能去……那颗陨石……”*口干舌燥“死去的东西会活过来……”"}
{"time": 1761145796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596331826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“死去的东西会活过来？”布莱恩警官皱着眉头，“先生你先别激动，也许是我的技艺不精，使你在潜意识中看到了一些不对劲的东西。你可以再思考一下，有什么客观的可以找到你的同伴的线索。”"}
{"time": 1761145991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349600352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“山顶……他会在那里……那颗陨石，还在吗？极光……很危险”"}
{"time": 1761146173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501641130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“山顶的位置对吧？还有没有更具体的地点或者线索呢？我们的救援飞机难以进入强磁场的极光，因此我们只有短短的搜查救援时间——我们需要更加精确的标志物进行定位。”"}
{"time": 1761146479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284434861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“山上会有一片……林子”"}
{"time": 1761146500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783526445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“绿色的，但是……不能去”"}
{"time": 1761146621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529587484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“虽然常理而言在高海拔的艾格峰上出现林子是一件不可能的事情......但是这会成为重要的线索，还有其他想到的吗？”"}
{"time": 1761146867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191212000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我不建议你们去救援”"}
{"time": 1761146895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74667624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是也许……山上的观测站会有更多有用的情报”"}
{"time": 1761146971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793453370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（你确定这样说嘛？）"}
