{"time": 1761147035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068255369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（好吧）"}
{"time": 1761147039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348708845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那里……不该去的。那里是降下惩罚的地方”"}
{"time": 1761147083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474165092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是被诅咒的地方……”"}
{"time": 1761147196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286153744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“好吧......我们会尽力搜索的......”说完后布莱恩急匆匆地出发了"}
{"time": 1761147255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220733826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "然而遗憾的是，在风雪恶劣天气以及磁场的干扰下，搜救队的直升机即便找到了你所描述的那些物品景象，但是你的同伴的踪迹却丝毫没有身影。"}
